      "hizbQuarter": 65,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1054,
      "text": "Is it not clear to those who inherit the land after its former people that, if We so willed, We could punish them for their sins and seal up their hearts so that they do not hear[38]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 100,
      "juz": 9,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 163,
      "ruku": 134,
      "hizbQuarter": 65,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1055,
      "text": "These are the towns, some of whose stories We relate to you. Their messengers came to them with clear proofs, but they were not about to believe in what they had already rejected[39]. This is how Allah seals up the hearts of the disbelievers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 101,
      "juz": 9,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 163,
      "ruku": 134,
      "hizbQuarter": 65,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1056,
      "text": "We did not find most of them committed to their covenant; rather We found most of them rebellious.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 102,
      "juz": 9,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 163,
      "ruku": 134,
      "hizbQuarter": 65,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1057,
      "text": "Then We sent after them Moses[40] with Our signs to Pharaoh and his chiefs, but they wrongfully rejected them. See how was the end of those who spread corruption.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 103,
      "juz": 9,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 163,
      "ruku": 134,
      "hizbQuarter": 65,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1058,
      "text": "Moses said, “O Pharaoh, I am a messenger from the Lord of the worlds.",
